ARGUMENTS: Storybook is already running at http://localhost:6006. Open the story iframe directly at http://localhost:6006/iframe.html?id=commerce-zimmwishlistauthdrawer--default&viewMode=story for each of three viewport widths: 390x844, 834x1194, 1440x900. At each viewport: the story should auto-open the ZimmDrawer (trigger it if it doesn't open automatically — look for a trigger button/children to click if the drawer isn't already open), then measure the computed bounding-box height in pixels of the drawer's header element (the element with the drawer's header row containing the title and close button — likely has a part/class related to "header", or is the first flex row inside the drawer panel containing the title text and a close button). Report the exact pixel height of that header element at each of the 3 viewports. Also report the computed padding-block (padding-top + padding-bottom) of that header element at each viewport. Do not modify any files — this is a read-only measurement task.

