198	 *
199	 * Pass `title` to render an inline header row (title text left, close button right) sized per the
200	 * Figma drawer/header frames. Omit `title` and pass `labelledBy`/`aria-label` instead for drawers
201	 * that supply their own header (e.g. ZimmPdpDrawer's tab row) — the close button floats on its own
202	 * by default. Add `boxedHeader` alongside `labelledBy` when the drawer has no header content of its
203	 * own (e.g. ZimmCountryLanguageMismatch, whose heading lives in its body) but still wants the close
204	 * button sitting in that same in-flow header row rather than floating over the content.
205	 *
206	 * @param props see ZimmDrawerProps
